            "start": 262,
            "end": 359,
            "quote": "TensorRT 在构建 engine 时（builder 阶段）自动做 layer fusion：解析 ONNX 等网络表示后，优化器会做常量折叠（constant folding）、垂直融合",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-21",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "223758e7d148a7fec2a92ce5c30e499e872b72cc2c6dd474f127096662d6d9eb",
            "start": 1615,
            "end": 1662,
            "quote": "官方没有\\\"禁止融合某两层\\\"的 API；可用 Plugin 层（IPluginV2）强制边界",
